                <pb facs="0469" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg371"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Peirce to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Peirce reports that the Russian Government approve Li Hung Chang’s
                    appointment, but that he should be required to exhibit quite satisfactory full
                    powers from a de facto government before beginning negotiations.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
